'''The 6th Angel''' is a [[:Category:EVA Angel Enemies|EVA Angel]] enemy that appears in the [[Neon Genesis Evangelion Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 6.10 Update|Version 6.10]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = The 6th Angel
|money drop = 5,000¢ - 19,750¢
|image = E 393.png
|appearance = [[Neon Genesis Evangelion Collaboration Event]]
}}

==Enemy==
This slow enemy stands at a very high 1,000 range that is effectively doubled by an Omni Strike reaching 2,000 ahead of it. With decent stats, Base Destroyer and somewhat high damage, it tends to be a huge threat in all of its appearances, but its long attack cycle often prevents it from actually pushing on its own.

==Strategy==
Like [[Codename "Red Riding"]], you must keep her far away from your base at all costs, as Omni Strike units stand at their maximum range against bases, and Base Destroyer enables her to quickly demolish it. Thankfully, the stages she appears in are very long, giving you a bit of breathing room. Tanky and fast units like [[Crazed Cow Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Cow Cat]] or [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Jamiera Cat]] are able to stall her well under the correct conditions.

You can also use the [[You Will Find Happiness (Combo)|You Will Find Happiness Cat]] Combo coupled with cats with the [[:Category:EVA Angel Killer Cats|EVA Angel Killer]] ability to defeat her. If your EVA Angel Killer [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Ubers]] are at around level 15+ they won't struggle much, if at all.

